1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
It starts with one small word...

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:10,000
...passed from ear to ear...

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:15,000
...until it reaches home.

4
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Today it takes a single tap to send it to everyone.

5
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:25,000
And soon, no one remembers why everyone is upset.

6
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:33,000
What if we had a small reminder, right before we press send?

7
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:38,000
Lashon Hara Guard. It notices, it asks, and it leaves the choice with you.

8
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:42,000
Download it from lap.ysho.uk...

9
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:47,000
...unzip it, turn on Developer mode, and choose Load unpacked...

10
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:52,000
...then pin it. Your guard is in place.

11
00:00:52,000 --> 00:01:00,000
It doesn't judge and it doesn't forbid. It just pauses you for a moment, and asks.

12
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:07,000
And sometimes, one moment changes everything.

13
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:16,000
When our words are kind, our hearts grow closer.

14
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:25,000
Lashon Hara Guard. Because a kind word builds a world.

